  "_about": "Rally cluster, generated by design/gen_rally.py (edit that and regenerate): a segmented rev arc sweeping across the top under the hood's curve (white, rally yellow from the shift zone, red and flashing at the redline), a huge gear in the middle (red at the shift point) with the speed under it, a G-meter on the left (the dot at the lateral and longitudinal g with a fading trail, the outline of the most g this drive in every direction, its range from the G-meter tab; the side and fore / aft g under it, then the best of the drive and the range), boost with a peak-hold bar and two readout slots on the right. Clear of BMW's black box and belt light. No map window. Widget reference: shared/hud.js header.",
